1
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:09,280
Greetings from the International Space Station!

2
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:15,620
On behalf of the Expedition 74 crew, coming to you from 250 miles above Earth, we are

3
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:21,600
excited to celebrate the FIFA World Cup with people from all over the world.

4
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:27,480
Here on the Space Station, we conduct research that drives exploration and innovation that

5
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:35,040
impacts life on Earth, even in sports performance, material sciences, and human endurance.

6
00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:40,720
In fact, because of research conducted on the Space Station, electronics are now included

7
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:46,200
in major tournament soccer balls for the 2026 World Cup, which ensure the soccer ball is

8
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:50,240
balanced statically and dynamically for best performance.

9
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:52,120
The World Cup is more than a tournament.

10
00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:58,240
It's a global phenomenon that pushes the boundaries of innovation, pioneers new technology,

11
00:00:58,240 --> 00:01:02,120
and drives human performance, similar to what we do here at NASA.

12
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:06,800
In the Artemis II mission, astronauts traveled farther than any human has traveled in over

13
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:11,400
50 years, and that was just the beginning.

14
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:16,560
We are focused on sending humans to the surface of the moon and to Mars.

15
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:22,120
But whether on the soccer pitch or in orbit, it's the connection to each other that

16
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:24,480
is so special.

17
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:30,080
From our view above planet Earth, as we gather with the same passion and excitement

18
00:01:30,080 --> 00:01:34,520
for the game, the world doesn't look like a collection of opposing sides.

19
00:01:34,520 --> 00:01:38,760
It looks like a masterpiece of cooperation.

20
00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:42,040
Different teams, same planet, one crew.

21
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:46,120
No matter who you're cheering for, cheer with all your heart, because we want to

22
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:48,320
hear that excitement all the way up here.

